====================================================
KEY TAKEAWAYS
====================================================

Day 17 was focused on understanding what top software engineering resumes actually look like.

Major realizations:
- strong resumes are built on strong skills
- projects matter only if they can be explained deeply
- fundamentals are more important than buzzwords
- consistency matters more than shortcuts

Today was less about coding.

More about understanding how to present myself as a stronger engineer.